/P 60 0 R
/E (In the very early days of weight training \(before steroids and protein powders\) strongmen and body builders trained very differently than we see today. They all trained their entire bodies, including their arms, between 3-5 days a week. Today its RARE to see anyone train a body part more than twice a week. In fact the bro split of training one body part a day thus training each body part once a week is the most common. Its no coincidence that weak muscles and small arms are also common.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
