/P 63 0 R
/E (The moderate rep range is the classic muscle building body builder rep range. In studies when compared to other rep ranges head to head the 8-12 reps range builds the most muscle every single time. This is probably why most people get stuck in this rep range, and once they get stuck for a few months their bodies stop responding. This rep range is awesome when its cycled with other rep ranges.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
