/P 63 0 R
/E (That is it folks. Do the above and be consistent and watch your arms finally respond. Forget the crazy techniques and supplements, just focus on getting strong at big, gross motor compound movements, train your arms daily with three heavy workouts and trigger sessions on all other days and cycle your rep ranges every 3-5 weeks and you will see results like you never have before.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
